        "original_text": "-- insert and delete elements until a rehash occur. Caller must ensure\n-- that a rehash will change the shape of the table. Must repeat because\n-- the insertion may collide with the deleted element, and then there is\n-- no rehash.\nlocal function forcerehash (t)\n  local na, nh = T.querytab(t)\n  local i = 10000\n  repeat\n    i = i + 1\n    t[i] = true\n    t[i] = undef\n    local nna, nnh = T.querytab(t)\n  until nna ~= na or nnh ~= nh\nend\n"
      },
      "classification": "private physical shape controls loop termination; mixed real insertion/deletion",
      "candidate": "separately reviewed bounded real churn/storage-safety counterpart; never substitute rows/live for geometry in existing repeat condition",
